'''Irida''' (Japanese: '''カイ''' ''Kai'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Heal 40 damage from each of your Pokémon that has any {{e|Water}} Energy attached.
}}

