==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to that of {{TCG|Lana}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but heals 40 damage instead of 50.
** {{TCG|Irida}} also exists in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but with a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Irida]] is the leader of the [[Pearl Clan]] in [[Pokémon Legends: Arceus]].

